    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/carpet-store/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Carpet Store theme is a sleek and versatile solution designed for carpet retailers, rug stores, flooring businesses, carpet distributors, carpet wholesalers, interior design stores, home decor shops, and online carpet stores looking to establish a professional online presence. With a visually stunning design, this theme allows you to showcase a wide range of carpets, area rugs, modern carpets, shag carpets, Persian carpets, Oriental carpets, luxury carpets, hand-knotted carpets, machine-made carpets, textured carpets, natural fiber carpets, sisal carpets, jute rugs, bamboo rugs, kids’ room carpets, bedroom carpets, living room carpets, hotel carpet flooring, restaurant carpets, hall carpets, exhibition carpets, event carpet rolls, tufted carpets, flat-weave carpets, geometric carpets, and floral carpets effortlessly. Whether selling carpets, rugs, or flooring accessories, the theme ensures your products are displayed beautifully with high-resolution images, interactive galleries, and an intuitive layout. Ideal for both commercial and residential carpet retailers, it provides a seamless shopping experience, helping customers browse colors, textures, patterns, sizes, and styles with ease. Designed with essential features like product catalogs, filtering options, price comparisons, customer reviews, and testimonials, this theme maximizes engagement and conversions. Fully responsive, mobile-friendly, retina-ready, and SEO-optimized, it ensures your store ranks higher in search engines while delivering a flawless experience on desktops, tablets, and smartphones. Compatible with essential plugins like WooCommerce for online sales, Contact Form 7 for inquiries, and Yoast SEO for improved search visibility, the theme also supports carpet installation services, carpet maintenance, professional carpet cleaning, and carpet repair promotion. With its elegant design, flexible features, and advanced customization options, Carpet Store empowers retailers to create a polished, professional, and highly functional online presence that highlights both products and services effectively."
    },
